{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Drevolesye \u2014 a village where every building breathes through the cracks, every villager sighs deeply, and hope is already packing its bags. It\u2019s here, thanks to fate (and one overly enthusiastic landlord), that you \u2014 an accidental hero and reluctant builder \u2014 find yourself, perhaps as the last hope for salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 Rebuilding a ruined village: build, repair, and upgrade to bring Drevolesye back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/049e445d501f1f5d1edb7d0320144c35.poster.avif?t=1755638136\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/049e445d501f1f5d1edb7d0320144c35.webm?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/049e445d501f1f5d1edb7d0320144c35.mp4?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Helping the locals: from a grumpy blacksmith to a fisherman-philosopher \u2014 everyone has problems, and they're more than happy to share them with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Fishing, logging, gathering resources: if you thought it would be easy \u2014 we regret to inform you otherwise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/b8c009aed785c5c1e42038fc5bef9091.poster.avif?t=1755638136\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/b8c009aed785c5c1e42038fc5bef9091.webm?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/b8c009aed785c5c1e42038fc5bef9091.mp4?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddd2\ufe0f Atmospheric quests: story-driven and random missions that uncover the village\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/0b2166d48e15db84124b3215079382eb.poster.avif?t=1755638136\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/0b2166d48e15db84124b3215079382eb.webm?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/0b2166d48e15db84124b3215079382eb.mp4?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd14\u00a0</strong>Choice-driven ending: decide whether to be a peaceful savior... or a hero who takes up the sword.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Drevolesye, every day is full of work, strange requests, and small wonders. Prepare to get your hands dirty, catch the most stubborn fish around, and maybe \u2014 just maybe \u2014 bring the village back to its former glory.<br>Or at least get the tavern serving something edible again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607100?t=1755638136","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607100?t=1755638136","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/495b2019378fdb2214771a463b905610e2da799e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755638136","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/495b2019378fdb2214771a463b905610e2da799e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755638136","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Drevolesye \u2014 a village where every building breathes through the cracks, every villager sighs deeply, and hope is already packing its bags. It\u2019s here, thanks to fate (and one overly enthusiastic landlord), that you \u2014 an accidental hero and reluctant builder \u2014 find yourself, perhaps as the last hope for salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 Rebuilding a ruined village: build, repair, and upgrade to bring Drevolesye back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/049e445d501f1f5d1edb7d0320144c35.poster.avif?t=1755638136\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/049e445d501f1f5d1edb7d0320144c35.webm?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/049e445d501f1f5d1edb7d0320144c35.mp4?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Helping the locals: from a grumpy blacksmith to a fisherman-philosopher \u2014 everyone has problems, and they're more than happy to share them with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 Fishing, logging, gathering resources: if you thought it would be easy \u2014 we regret to inform you otherwise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/b8c009aed785c5c1e42038fc5bef9091.poster.avif?t=1755638136\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/b8c009aed785c5c1e42038fc5bef9091.webm?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/b8c009aed785c5c1e42038fc5bef9091.mp4?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddd2\ufe0f Atmospheric quests: story-driven and random missions that uncover the village\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/0b2166d48e15db84124b3215079382eb.poster.avif?t=1755638136\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/0b2166d48e15db84124b3215079382eb.webm?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607100/extras/0b2166d48e15db84124b3215079382eb.mp4?t=1755638136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd14\u00a0</strong>Choice-driven ending: decide whether to be a peaceful savior... or a hero who takes up the sword.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Drevolesye, every day is full of work, strange requests, and small wonders. Prepare to get your hands dirty, catch the most stubborn fish around, and maybe \u2014 just maybe \u2014 bring the village back to its former glory.<br>Or at least get the tavern serving something edible again.</p>","developers":["TwinPathGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_ima